From e10ee49fd17cee091700dff3352e624359ce25eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: newjordan <newjordan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 19:15:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] tools: add reap-collect (router-weighted expert saliency
 collector)

cb_eval taps ffn_moe_down (expert ids) + ffn_moe_weighted (g*||f|| norm) per layer; emits per-(layer,expert) saliency GGUF for REAP scoring. Used for the REAP prune experiment (dropped; see docs/reap-results.md).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
